---
// "Ken Burns": zoom lentissimo sulla foto della copertina, con una luce di sole che la attraversa.
---

<div class="ken-burns pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="sun"></span>
</div>

<style>
  /* Lo zoom agisce sull'immagine della copertina che precede l'effetto */
  :global(.cover:has(> .ken-burns) > img) {
    animation: kb-zoom 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    transform-origin: 62% 45%;
  }
  .ken-burns {
    overflow: hidden;
    mix-blend-mode: soft-light;
  }
  .sun {
    position: absolute;
    top: -30%;
    left: -60%;
    width: 55%;
    height: 160%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #fff3c6cc 45%, #ffe39a99 55%, transparent);
    filter: blur(24px);
    transform: rotate(18deg);
    animation: kb-sun 11s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes kb-zoom {
    from { transform: scale(1); }
    to { transform: scale(1.1); }
  }
  @keyframes kb-sun {
    0%, 15% { left: -60%; opacity: 0; }
    30% { opacity: 1; }
    70% { opacity: 1; }
    85%, 100% { left: 120%; opacity: 0; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(.cover:has(> .ken-burns) > img) { animation: none; }
    .sun { display: none; }
  }
</style>
